ock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssue occurred in 6ef60dc279b2c58a94ffc57bf98eefc9663f7907.  I think this has been introduced since the 30th. I'm investigating now to try to find the culprit.  Suspect https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (b6106dff7) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 59.95 Hz) - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) Arc(TM) A750 Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.6790) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F (12 threads) - 31.81 GiB memory - WASAPI (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen attempting to build with renderingdevice disabled, the following build error will occur:\n\n```\nERROR: In file included from ./servers/rendering/renderer_rd/renderer_compositor_rd.h:45,\n                 from platform\\windows\\display_server_windows.cpp:57:\n./servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/utilities.h:115:50: error: 'virtual RenderingDeviceEnums::DeviceType RendererRD::Utilities::get_video_adapter_type() const' marked 'override', but does not override\n  115 |         virtual RenderingDeviceEnums::DeviceType get_video_adapter_type() const override;\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n`scons target=template_release lto=full build_profile=\"engine_compilation_profile.gdbuild\"`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[engine_compilation_profile.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31758272/engine_compilation_profile.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.g